      "content": "The drivers are starting to get really vocal about the new shift rotations. They're claiming the sleep windows are too short and it's becoming a safety issue. We can't have them organizing a walkout over this. I need you to draft a formal memo for the regional managers that justifies these current schedules. Make sure it emphasizes how the new system actually improves efficiency and stays fully compliant with all safety and rest standards. We need to shut this narrative down before it gains traction.",
